{"page":359,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:62","surah":24,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ وَإِذَا كَانُوا۟ مَعَهُۥ عَلَىٰٓ أَمْرٍ جَامِعٍ لَّمْ يَذْهَبُوا۟ حَتَّىٰ يَسْتَـْٔذِنُوهُ ۚ إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَسْتَـْٔذِنُونَكَ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۚ فَإِذَا ٱسْتَـْٔذَنُوكَ لِبَعْضِ شَأْنِهِمْ فَأْذَن لِّمَن شِئْتَ مِنْهُمْ وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ لَهُمُ ٱللَّهَ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The true believers are those who believe in God and His Mes-senger, who, when they are gathered with him on a communal matter, do not depart until they have asked his permission- those who ask your permission [Prophet] are the ones who truly believe in God and His Messenger. When they ask your permission to attend to their private affairs, allow whoever you see fit and ask God to forgive them. God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlihi","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"and when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they are","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَعَهُۥ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"maʿahu","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَمْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"a matter","transliteration":"amrin","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَامِعٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) collective action","transliteration":"jāmiʿin","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَذْهَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they go","transliteration":"yadhhabū","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":15,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَسْتَـْٔذِنُوهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"they (have) asked his permission","transliteration":"yastadhinūhu","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَسْتَـْٔذِنُونَكَ","en_gloss":"ask your permission","transliteration":"yastadhinūnaka","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"[those who]","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":23,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlihi","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":25,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"So when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ٱسْتَـْٔذَنُوكَ","en_gloss":"they ask your permission","transliteration":"is'tadhanūka","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":27,"ar":"لِبَعْضِ","en_gloss":"for some","transliteration":"libaʿḍi","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":28,"ar":"شَأْنِهِمْ","en_gloss":"affair of theirs","transliteration":"shanihim","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":29,"ar":"فَأْذَن","en_gloss":"then give permission","transliteration":"fadhan","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":30,"ar":"لِّمَن","en_gloss":"to whom","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":31,"ar":"شِئْتَ","en_gloss":"you will","transliteration":"shi'ta","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":32,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":33,"ar":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"and ask forgiveness","transliteration":"wa-is'taghfir","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":34,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":35,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":36,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":37,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":38,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":39,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"24:62"},{"pos":40,"ar":"٦٢","en_gloss":"(62)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:62"}]},{"verse_key":"24:63","surah":24,"ayah":63,"ar_uthmani":"لَّا تَجْعَلُوا۟ دُعَآءَ ٱلرَّسُولِ بَيْنَكُمْ كَدُعَآءِ بَعْضِكُم بَعْضًا ۚ قَدْ يَعْلَمُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَتَسَلَّلُونَ مِنكُمْ لِوَاذًا ۚ فَلْيَحْذَرِ ٱلَّذِينَ يُخَالِفُونَ عَنْ أَمْرِهِۦٓ أَن تُصِيبَهُمْ فِتْنَةٌ أَوْ يُصِيبَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[People], do not regard the Messenger’s summons to you like one of you summoning another- God is well aware of those of you who steal away surreptitiously- and those who go against his order should beware lest a trial afflict them or they receive a painful punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:63"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَجْعَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"make","transliteration":"tajʿalū","verse_key":"24:63"},{"pos":3,"ar":"دُعَآءَ","en_gloss":"(the) calling","transliteration":"duʿāa","verse_key":"24:63"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūli","verse_key":"24:63"},{"pos":5,"a