oss":"befalls them","transliteration":"yuṣībahum","verse_key":"24:63"},{"pos":26,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"24:63"},{"pos":27,"ar":"أَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmun","verse_key":"24:63"},{"pos":28,"ar":"٦٣","en_gloss":"(63)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:63"}]},{"verse_key":"24:64","surah":24,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَآ إِنَّ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ قَدْ يَعْلَمُ مَآ أَنتُمْ عَلَيْهِ وَيَوْمَ يُرْجَعُونَ إِلَيْهِ فَيُنَبِّئُهُم بِمَا عَمِلُوا۟ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌۢ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Everything in the heavens and earth belongs to God: He knows what state you are in- on the Day when all are returned to Him, He will tell them everything they have done- God has full knowledge of everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَآ","en_gloss":"No doubt","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah (belongs)","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"He knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"(are) on [it]","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يُرْجَعُونَ","en_gloss":"they will be returned","transliteration":"yur'jaʿūna","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَيُنَبِّئُهُم","en_gloss":"then He will inform them","transliteration":"fayunabbi-uhum","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":20,"ar":"بِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"of every","transliteration":"bikulli","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":21,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":22,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"24:64"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٦٤","en_gloss":"(64)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:64"}]},{"verse_key":"25:1","surah":25,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" تَبَارَكَ ٱلَّذِى نَزَّلَ ٱلْفُرْقَانَ عَلَىٰ عَبْدِهِۦ لِيَكُونَ لِلْعَـٰلَمِينَ نَذِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Exalted is He who has sent the Differentiator down to His servant so that it may be a warning to all people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"تَبَارَكَ","en_gloss":"Blessed is He","transliteration":"tabāraka","verse_key":"25:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"25:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَزَّلَ","en_gloss":"sent down","transliteration":"nazzala","verse_key":"25:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْفُرْقَانَ","en_gloss":"the Criterion","transliteration":"l-fur'qāna","verse_key":"25:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"25:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَبْدِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His slave","transliteration":"ʿabdihi","verse_key":"25:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِيَكُونَ","en_gloss":"that he may be","trans